  "stemZh": "您有一个名为 App1 的 Python 应用程序，它与一个名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目集成。\n您需要确保 App1 满足以下要求：\n使用 Microsoft Entra 管理的身份进行身份验证\n通过 Azure OpenAI Responses API 向已部署的模型发送提示\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a Python application named App1 that integrates with a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1.\nYou need to ensure that App1 meets the following requirements:\nAuthenticates by using a Microsoft Entra managed identity\nSends prompts to a deployed model by using the Azure OpenAI Responses API\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "解释：\n框 1：DefaultAzureCredential\nazure.identity 包提供 DefaultAzureCredential，它会自动评估 environment 以找到有效的身份验证机制。当在 Azure 中部署时，它会原生获取配置的 Microsoft Entra 管理身份，而无需硬编码的密钥。\n框 2：create\nget_openai_client() 上下文管理器返回一个与 OpenAI 兼容的实例，预先为您的项目端点配置。要使用 Microsoft Foundry 的 Responses API 协议生成响应，您需要与.responses 资源进行交互并调用其 create 方法。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: DefaultAzureCredential\nThe azure.identity package provides DefaultAzureCredential, which automatically evaluates the environment to find a valid authentication mechanism. When deployed in Azure, it natively picks up the configured Microsoft Entra managed identity without requiring hardcoded secrets.\nBox 2: create\nThe get_openai_client() context manager returns an OpenAI-compatible instance pre-configured for your project endpoint. To generate responses using Microsoft Foundry's Responses API protocol, you interact with the .responses resource and call its create method.",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution",
  "control": "select",
  "template": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\n\ncredential = {{1}}()\n\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=\"https://contosoai.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\",\n    credential=credential,\n)\n\nwith project_client.get_openai_client() as openai_client:\n    response = openai_client.responses.{{2}}(\n        model=\"trail-guide-chat\",\n        input=\"Create a 3-day hiking itinerary near Seattle.\",\n    )\n    print(response.output_text)",
  "templateEn": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\n\ncredential = {{1}}()\n\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=\"https://contosoai.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\",\n    credential=credential,\n)\n\nwith project_client.get_openai_client() as openai_client:\n    response = openai_client.responses.{{2}}(\n        model=\"trail-guide-chat\",\n        input=\"Create a 3-day hiking itinerary near Seattle.\",\n    )\n    print(response.output_text)",
  "templateZh": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\n\ncredential = {{1}}()\n\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=\"https://contosoai.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\",\n    credential=credential,\n)\n\nwith project_client.get_openai_client() as openai_client:\n    response = openai_client.responses.{{2}}(\n        model=\"trail-guide-chat\",\n        input=\"Create a 3-day hiking itinerary near Seattle.\",\n    )\n    print(response.output_text)",
