  "stemZh": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目，其中包含一个使用 FoundryAgent Service 构建的客户支持代理。\n该代理通过工单工具将用户提供的屏幕截图上传到 Azure 存储，并接收一个 blob URL 以进行额外推理。\n您需要在代理运行期间使用图像审核，并防止有害内容在运行期间被返回。Azure AI 内容安全必须通过 blob URL 访问图像。解决方案必须遵循最小权限原则。\n您应该为内容安全配置什么？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support agent built by using the Foundry Agent Service.\nThe agent uploads user-provided screenshots to Azure Storage through a ticketing tool and receives a blob URL for additional reasoning.\nYou need to use image moderation during agent runs and prevent harmful content from being returned during runs. Azure AI Content Safety must access the images by using the blob URL. The solution must follow the principle of least privilege.\nWhat should you configure for Content Safety? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：选择用户输入、输出、工具响应和工具调用，并将操作设置为阻止。\n保护措施\n正确的配置选项是：选择用户输入、输出、工具响应和工具调用，并将操作设置为阻止。\n覆盖点：\nMicrosoft Foundry Guardrails 支持四个关键干预点：用户输入、工具调用、工具响应，和输出。为了彻底保护代理运行不受有害输入、隐藏指令或生成的漏洞影响，生命周期的每个阶段都必须进行扫描。\n工具调用和工具响应：\n由于客户支持代理通过工单工具动态上传文件和处理 blob URL，评估工具调用（代理发送的内容）和 PM/工具响应（工具返回给代理的内容）对于防止间接提示注入或恶意内容在运行时处理至关重要。\n操作模式：\n将操作设置为阻止确保在生命周期的任何时刻检测到任何有害内容或政策违规时，应用程序会积极防止其执行或返回给用户，从而满足严格的安全要求。\n不正确：\n* 选择工具调用并将操作设置为阻止\n仅选择工具调用会使主要用户提示、工具输出和最终代理响应完全不受监管。此外，“黑色”不是有效的配置操作。\n* 选择用户输入和输出并将操作设置为注释\n和\n* 选择用户输入和工具响应并将操作设置为注释\n将操作设置为注释会用安全元数据/严重性评分标记或标记内容，但不会主动阻止运行或防止有害内容被返回。此外，这些选项省略了必要的干预点（例如工具调用），违反了代理工作流的安全约束。\n框 2：一个系统分配的托管身份，分配了存储 Blob 数据读取器角色存储访问\n为了最佳配置图像审核的存储访问，您应该在 Azure AI 内容安全实例上启用系统分配的托管身份，并将其分配为 Azure 存储帐户上的存储 Blob 数据读取器角色。这消除了在代理执行期间传递原始存储帐户密钥或生成不安全的共享访问签名（SAS）令牌的安全风险。\nfba1abcc0eed",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Select user input, output, tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block.\nGuardrails\nThe correct configuration is option is: Select user input, output, tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block.\nPoints Coverage:\nMicrosoft Foundry Guardrails support four key intervention points: User input, Tool call, Tool response, and Output. To thoroughly secure an agent run from harmful inputs, hidden instructions, or generated vulnerabilities, every stage of the lifecycle must be scanned.\nTool Call and Tool Response:\nBecause the customer support agent uploads files and processes blob URLs dynamically via a ticketing tool, evaluating both Tool call (what the agent sends) and PM/Tool response (what the tool sends back to the agent) is critical to prevent indirect prompt injections or malicious content processing at runtime. Action Mode:\nSetting the action to Block ensures that if any harmful content or policy violation is detected at any point in the cycle, the application aggressively prevents it from executing or returning to the user, satisfying the strict safety mandate.\nIncorrect:\n* Select Tool call and set Action to Block\nSelecting only Tool call leaves the primary user prompt, tool output, and final agent response completely unmoderated. Furthermore, \"Black\" is not a valid configuration action.\n* Select user input and Output and Set action to Annotate\nand\n* Select user input and Tool response and set Action to Annotate\nSetting the action to Annotate flags or labels content with safety metadata/severity scores but does not proactively block the run or prevent harmful content from being returned. Additionally, these options omit necessary intervention points (such as Tool call), violating the security constraints of the agentic workflow.\nBox 2: A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role Storage access\nTo best configure storage access for image moderation, you should enable a system-assigned managed identity on the Azure AI Content Safety instance and assign it the Storage Blob Data Reader role on the Azure Storage account. This eliminates the security risk of passing raw storage account keys or generating insecure Shared Access Signature (SAS) tokens during agent execution.\nfba1abcc0eed",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
