  "type": "single",
  "stem": "您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理具有一个模型上下文协议（MCP）工具，用于查询存储在 Azure AI Search 中的知识库。\n某些代理运行返回来自基础模型的答案，而不调用知识库，这导致响应没有基于引用。\n您提供了以下运行代理的代码片段。\n```\nrun = project_client.agents.runs.create_and_process(\n    thread_id=thread.id,\n    agent_id=agent.id\n)\n```\n您需要在代码中添加正确的 tool _choice 参数，以确定性地强制代理在每次运行时调用 MCP 工具。\n您应该添加什么？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "tool_choice={“required”}",
    "textEn": "tool_choice={“required”}",
    "textZh": "tool_choice={“required”}"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "tool_choice={“auto”}",
    "textEn": "tool_choice={“auto”}",
    "textZh": "tool_choice={“auto”}"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "tool_choice={“type”:“knowledge_base”}",
    "textEn": "tool_choice={“type”:“knowledge_base”}",
    "textZh": "tool_choice={“type”:“knowledge_base”}"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "tool_choice ={“type”:“mcp”}",
    "textEn": "tool_choice ={“type”:“mcp”}",
    "textZh": "tool_choice ={“type”:“mcp”}"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "A"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "A"
  ],
  "explanation": "要强制代理在每次运行时确定性地调用您的模型上下文协议（MCP）工具，您必须将 tool_choice=\"required\" 传递给 run_create_and_process 方法。\n“required”工具选择：将此参数设置为“required”会强制底层的 Azure OpenAI 模型在每个响应中调用您可用的工具之一，确保代理不会从基础模型中猜测答案。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理具有一个模型上下文协议（MCP）工具，用于查询存储在 Azure AI Search 中的知识库。\n某些代理运行返回来自基础模型的答案，而不调用知识库，这导致响应没有基于引用。\n您提供了以下运行代理的代码片段。\n```\nrun = project_client.agents.runs.create_and_process(\n    thread_id=thread.id,\n    agent_id=agent.id\n)\n```\n您需要在代码中添加正确的 tool _choice 参数，以确定性地强制代理在每次运行时调用 MCP 工具。\n您应该添加什么？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent has a Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool that queries a knowledge base stored in Azure AI Search.\nSome agent runs return answers from the base model without invoking the knowledge base, which results in responses without grounded citations.\nYou are provided with the following code snippet that runs the agent.\n```\nrun = project_client.agents.runs.create_and_process(\n    thread_id=thread.id,\n    agent_id=agent.id\n)\n```\nYou need to add the correct tool _choice parameter to the code to deterministically force the agent to invoke the MCP tool on each run.\nWhat should you add?",
  "explanationZh": "要强制代理在每次运行时确定性地调用您的模型上下文协议（MCP）工具，您必须将 tool_choice=\"required\" 传递给 run_create_and_process 方法。\n“required”工具选择：将此参数设置为“required”会强制底层的 Azure OpenAI 模型在每个响应中调用您可用的工具之一，确保代理不会从基础模型中猜测答案。",
  "explanationEn": "To deterministically force the agent to invoke your Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool on every run, you must pass tool_choice=\"required\" into the run_create_and_process method.\nThe 'required' tool choice: Setting this parameter to 'required' forces the underlying Azure OpenAI model to invoke one of your available tools on every response, ensuring the agent doesn't guess answers from the base model.",
  "boxes": [],
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
