  "explanation": "要确定模型输入、模型输出或扩展工具使用是否导致成本激增，您应该关注令牌使用。\n对令牌使用的细粒度跟踪直接分解成本：\n输入与输出令牌：跟踪令牌使用可以隔离用户提示（输入）是否增加，或者模型是否生成了更长、更昂贵的响应（输出）。\n工具调用：每次代理架构处理执行循环时，扩展工具使用会消耗额外的令牌，这将明显反映为膨胀的令牌计数。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个包含高流量代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n在最近的更新后，运营成本显著增加。\n监控确认用户流量到代理的数量保持不变。\n您怀疑请求或响应特征的变化导致了成本的增加。您需要确定额外的成本是由模型输入大小、模型输出大小还是扩展工具使用引起的。\n您应该使用哪种可观察性能力？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a high-traffic agent.\nAfter a recent update, operational costs increase significantly.\nMonitoring confirms that the volume of user traffic to the agent remains unchanged.\nYou suspect that changes to the request or response characteristics are causing the increase. You need to identify whether the additional costs are driven by the model input size, the model output size, or expanded tool usage.\nWhich observability capability should you use?",
  "explanationZh": "要确定模型输入、模型输出或扩展工具使用是否导致成本激增，您应该关注令牌使用。\n对令牌使用的细粒度跟踪直接分解成本：\n输入与输出令牌：跟踪令牌使用可以隔离用户提示（输入）是否增加，或者模型是否生成了更长、更昂贵的响应（输出）。\n工具调用：每次代理架构处理执行循环时，扩展工具使用会消耗额外的令牌，这将明显反映为膨胀的令牌计数。",
  "explanationEn": "To identify whether model input, model output, or expanded tool usage is driving the cost spike, you should focus on token usage.\nGranular tracking of token usage breaks down the costs directly:\nInput vs. Output Tokens: Tracing token usage isolates whether the user prompt (input) has grown or if the model is generating longer, more expensive responses (output).\nTool Calling: Expanded tool usage consumes extra tokens each time the agent schema processes an execution loop, which will clearly reflect as inflated token counts.",
