  "type": "single",
  "stem": "您有一个包含名为 Agent1 的代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\nAgent1 成功运行，但 Foundry 控制平面不显示错误率、运行次数和 token 使用情况的值，并且跟踪选项卡为空。\n您需要确保 Foundry 控制平面显示 Agent1 的适当值。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "Update Agent1 to a new version",
    "textEn": "Update Agent1 to a new version.",
    "textZh": "将 Agent1 更新到新版本。"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "Restart Agent1 from Foundry Control Plane",
    "textEn": "Restart Agent1 from Foundry Control Plane.",
    "textZh": "从 Foundry 控制平面重启 Agent1。"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "Assign a Log Analytics workspace to Agent1",
    "textEn": "Assign a Log Analytics workspace to Agent1.",
    "textZh": "将日志分析工作区分配给 Agent1。"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "Enable Application Insights for Agent1",
    "textEn": "Enable Application Insights for Agent1.",
    "textZh": "为 Agent1 启用应用程序洞察。"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "D"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "D"
  ],
  "explanation": "要解决此问题，您必须为您的Microsoft Foundry 项目连接并配置 Azure 应用程序洞察资源。\nFoundry 控制平面、其代理监控仪表板和跟踪选项卡直接依赖于存储在连接的应用程序洞察实例中的遥测 data。如果此资源缺失、未链接或配置不当，仪表板将无法显示运行、错误率、令牌使用情况或事务跨度。\nfoundry/4517250",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个包含名为 Agent1 的代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\nAgent1 成功运行，但 Foundry 控制平面不显示错误率、运行次数和 token 使用情况的值，并且跟踪选项卡为空。\n您需要确保 Foundry 控制平面显示 Agent1 的适当值。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent named Agent1.\nAgent1 runs successfully, but Foundry Control Plane does NOT display values for error rates, runs, and token usage, and the Traces tab is empty.\nYou need to ensure that Foundry Control Plane displays the appropriate values for Agent1.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "要解决此问题，您必须为您的Microsoft Foundry 项目连接并配置 Azure 应用程序洞察资源。\nFoundry 控制平面、其代理监控仪表板和跟踪选项卡直接依赖于存储在连接的应用程序洞察实例中的遥测 data。如果此资源缺失、未链接或配置不当，仪表板将无法显示运行、错误率、令牌使用情况或事务跨度。\nfoundry/4517250",
  "explanationEn": "To resolve this issue, you must connect and configure an Azure Application Insights resource for your Microsoft Foundry project.\nThe Foundry Control Plane, its Agent Monitoring Dashboard, and the Traces tab rely directly on telemetry data stored within the connected Application Insights instance. If this resource is missing, unlinked, or improperly configured, the dashboard cannot display runs, error rates, token usage, or transaction spans.\nfoundry/4517250",
