  "domainLabel": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "type": "single",
  "stem": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您需要从模型目录中部署一个模型以支持实时推理。解决方案必须满足以下要求：\n使用基于密钥的身份验证。\n支持实时 REST API 访问。\n不消耗 Azure 订阅中虚拟机的 vCPU 配额。\n您应该使用哪种类型的部署？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "serverless API",
    "textEn": "serverless API",
    "textZh": "无服务器 API"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "batch",
    "textEn": "batch",
    "textZh": "批处理"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "self-hosted container",
    "textEn": "self-hosted container",
    "textZh": "自托管容器"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "standard",
    "textEn": "standard",
    "textZh": "标准"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "D"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "D"
  ],
  "explanation": "说明：\n最合适的部署类型是无服务器 API 部署（也称为标准部署或模型即服务 / MaaS）。\n基于密钥的身份验证：无服务器 API 部署本地提供一个端点 URL，以及主 API 密钥和次 API 密钥，以保护您的客户端应用程序。\n实时 REST API 访问：当模型成功部署时，它会暴露一个可扩展的实时 HTTP/REST 端点，匹配标准化的 Azure AI 模型推理 API。\n没有虚拟机 vCPU 配额消耗：与托管计算部署不同——后者在您的订阅中配置专用虚拟机并需要 VM vCPU 配额——无服务器 API 部署完全由微软托管和管理。它们采用按需付费、基于令牌的计费结构，并且不会消耗您 Azure 订阅中的任何 VM vCPU 配额。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您需要从模型目录中部署一个模型以支持实时推理。解决方案必须满足以下要求：\n使用基于密钥的身份验证。\n支持实时 REST API 访问。\n不消耗 Azure 订阅中虚拟机的 vCPU 配额。\n您应该使用哪种类型的部署？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou need to deploy a model from the model catalog to support real-time inference. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nUse key-based authentication.\nSupport real-time REST API access.\nNOT consume the vCPU quota of the virtual machines in the Azure subscription.\nWhich type of deployment should you use?",
  "explanationZh": "说明：\n最合适的部署类型是无服务器 API 部署（也称为标准部署或模型即服务 / MaaS）。\n基于密钥的身份验证：无服务器 API 部署本地提供一个端点 URL，以及主 API 密钥和次 API 密钥，以保护您的客户端应用程序。\n实时 REST API 访问：当模型成功部署时，它会暴露一个可扩展的实时 HTTP/REST 端点，匹配标准化的 Azure AI 模型推理 API。\n没有虚拟机 vCPU 配额消耗：与托管计算部署不同——后者在您的订阅中配置专用虚拟机并需要 VM vCPU 配额——无服务器 API 部署完全由微软托管和管理。它们采用按需付费、基于令牌的计费结构，并且不会消耗您 Azure 订阅中的任何 VM vCPU 配额。",
  "explanationEn": "The most appropriate type of deployment is a serverless API deployment (also referred to as a standard deployment or Models-as-a-Service / MaaS).\nKey-Based Authentication: Serverless API deployments natively provision an endpoint URL alongside primary and secondary API keys to secure your client applications.\nReal-Time REST API Access: When the model is successfully deployed, it exposes a scalable, real-time HTTP/REST endpoint matching the standardized Azure AI Model Inference API.\nNo Virtual Machine vCPU Quota Consumption: Unlike managed compute deployments—which provision dedicated virtual machines in your subscription and require VM vCPU quota—serverless API deployments are completely hosted and managed by Microsoft. They operate on a pay-as-you-go, token-based billing structure and do not consume any VM vCPU quota from your Azure subscription.",
