  "explanation": "要部署 DALL-E 模型，您需要 Microsoft Foundry 和 Azure 命令行界面 (CLI)。\n部署与应用逻辑：Azure CLI 和 Microsoft Foundry 处理所需的管理基础设施层，以便在您的订阅中配置、设置和管理模型部署。\n不正确：\n[不是 B]\nSDK 的角色：Azure JavaScript SDK 是一个客户端开发库。它在您的代码中用于在模型已部署后调用或消费模型的 API。它不能部署 DALL-E 模型资产本身。\n工作室说明：虽然 Azure 机器学习工作室管理自定义 ML 流水线，但像 DALL-E 这样的基础生成 AI 模型是通过 Microsoft Foundry 门户及其相关生态系统进行配置和托管的。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您拥有一个 Azure 订阅。\n您计划构建一个将使用 Azure AI DALL-E 模型的应用程序。\n您需要部署该模型。\n你应该使用什么？",
  "stemEn": "You have an Azure subscription.\nYou plan to build an app that will use the Azure AI DALL-E model.\nYou need to deploy the model.\nWhat should you use?",
  "explanationZh": "要部署 DALL-E 模型，您需要 Microsoft Foundry 和 Azure 命令行界面 (CLI)。\n部署与应用逻辑：Azure CLI 和 Microsoft Foundry 处理所需的管理基础设施层，以便在您的订阅中配置、设置和管理模型部署。\n不正确：\n[不是 B]\nSDK 的角色：Azure JavaScript SDK 是一个客户端开发库。它在您的代码中用于在模型已部署后调用或消费模型的 API。它不能部署 DALL-E 模型资产本身。\n工作室说明：虽然 Azure 机器学习工作室管理自定义 ML 流水线，但像 DALL-E 这样的基础生成 AI 模型是通过 Microsoft Foundry 门户及其相关生态系统进行配置和托管的。",
  "explanationEn": "To deploy the DALL-E model, you need Microsoft Foundry and the Azure Command Line Interface (CLI).\nDeployment vs. Application Logic: The Azure CLI along with Microsoft Foundry handles the administrative infrastructure layer required to provision, configure, and manage model deployments within your subscription.\nIncorrect:\n[Not B]\nThe Role of the SDK: The Azure SDK for JavaScript is a client-side development library. It is used within your code to consume or call the model's API after it has already been deployed. It cannot deploy the DALL-E model asset itself.\nStudio Clarification: While Azure Machine Learning Studio manages custom ML pipelines, foundational generative AI models like DALL-E are provisioned and hosted through the Microsoft Foundry portal and its associated ecosystem.",
