  "explanation": "配置 Azure AI 服务虚拟网络\nAzure AI 服务提供分层安全模型。该模型使您能够将 Azure AI服务帐户的安全性限制为特定子集的网络。当配置网络规则时，只有通过指定网络集请求数据的应用程序才能访问该帐户。您可以通过请求过滤限制对资源的访问，该过滤允许仅来自指定 IP 地址、IP范围或 Azure 虚拟网络中子网列表的请求。\n在网络规则生效时，访问 Azure AI 服务资源的应用程序需要 authorization。授权支持 Microsoft Entra ID 凭据或有效的 API 密钥。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您正在 Azure 中构建一个解决方案，该解决方案将使用 Azure Language in Foundry Tools 服务来处理敏感客户数据。\n您需要确保只有特定的 Azure 进程可以访问 Language 服务。该解决方案必须最小化管理工作。\n您应该在解决方案中包含什么？",
  "stemEn": "You are building a solution in Azure that will use Azure Language in Foundry Tools service to process sensitive customer data.\nYou need to ensure that only specific Azure processes can access the Language service. The solution must minimize administrative effort.\nWhat should you include in the solution?",
  "explanationZh": "配置 Azure AI 服务虚拟网络\nAzure AI 服务提供分层安全模型。该模型使您能够将 Azure AI服务帐户的安全性限制为特定子集的网络。当配置网络规则时，只有通过指定网络集请求数据的应用程序才能访问该帐户。您可以通过请求过滤限制对资源的访问，该过滤允许仅来自指定 IP 地址、IP范围或 Azure 虚拟网络中子网列表的请求。\n在网络规则生效时，访问 Azure AI 服务资源的应用程序需要 authorization。授权支持 Microsoft Entra ID 凭据或有效的 API 密钥。",
  "explanationEn": "Configure Azure AI services virtual networks\nAzure AI services provide a layered security model. This model enables you to secure your Azure AI services accounts to a specific subset of networks. When network rules are configured, only applications that request data over the specified set of networks can access the account. You can limit access to your resources with request filtering, which allows requests that originate only from specified IP addresses, IP ranges, or from a list of subnets in Azure Virtual Networks.\nAn application that accesses an Azure AI services resource when network rules are in effect requires authorization. Authorization is supported with Microsoft Entra ID credentials or with a valid API key.",
