  "stemZh": "您正在构建一个应用程序，该应用程序将扫描机密文档，并使用 Azure Language in Foundry Tools 服务分析内容。\n您配置了一个 Microsoft Foundry Service 资源。\n您需要确保该应用程序可以向 Azure Language in Foundry Tools 服务端点发出请求。解决方案必须确保机密文档保持在本地。\n您应该按顺序执行哪三个操作？要回答，请将适当的操作从操作列表移动到答案区域，并按正确顺序排列。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You are building an app that will scan confidential documents and use the Azure Language in Foundry Tools service to analyze the contents.\nYou provision a Microsoft Foundry Service resource.\nYou need to ensure that the app can make requests to the Azure Language in Foundry Tools service endpoint. The solution must ensure that confidential documents remain on-premises.\nWhich three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "步骤 1：从 Docker Hub 拉取镜像\nAzure 认知服务提供多个 Docker 容器，让您可以在本地使用与 Azure 中相同的 API。使用这些容器可以灵活地将认知服务更接近您的数据，以满足合规性、安全性或其他操作原因。目前，容器支持仅适用于部分 Azure 认知服务。\n先决条件在使用 Azure 认知服务容器之前，您必须满足以下先决条件：\n* Docker 引擎：您必须在本地安装 Docker 引擎。\n* 等等。\n步骤 2：提供一个与互联网隔离的本地 Kubernetes 集群。\n解决方案必须确保机密文档保留在本地。\n认知服务容器的消费者可以通过前端组件增强容器，保持容器端点私密。\n不正确：\n* 提供一个具有互联网连接的本地 Kubernetes 集群\n* 提供一个 Azure Kubernetes 服务 (AKS) 资源。\n步骤 3：运行容器并指定 API 密钥和 Azure AI 资源的端点 URL\n您需要确保应用程序可以向语言服务端点发出请求。\n不正确：\n* : 运行容器并指定 AppID 和客户端密钥。",
  "explanationEn": "Step 1: Pull an image from Docker Hub\nAzure Cognitive Services provides several Docker containers that let you use the same APIs that are available in Azure, on-premises. Using these containers gives you the flexibility to bring Cognitive Services closer to your data for compliance, security or other operational reasons. Container support is currently available for a subset of Azure Cognitive Services.\nPrerequisites\nYou must satisfy the following prerequisites before using Azure Cognitive Services containers:\n* Docker Engine: You must have Docker Engine installed locally.\n* Etc.\nStep 2: Provision an on-premises Kubernetes cluster that is isolated from the internet.\nThe solution must ensure that confidential documents remain on-premises.\nConsumers of Cognitive Services containers could augment a container with a front-facing component, keeping the container endpoint private.\nIncorrect:\n* Provision an on-premises Kubernetes cluster that has internet connectivity\n* Provision an Azure Kubernets Services (AKS) resource.\nStep 3: Run the container and specify an API key and the Endpoint URL of the Azure AI resource\nYou need to ensure that the app can make requests to the Language service endpoint.\nIncorrect:\n* : Run the container and specify an AppID and Client Secret.",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution",
  "control": "drag",
