  "stemZh": "您有一个名为 AI1 的 Microsoft Foundry 资源，托管了三次 GPT 3.5 模型的部署。每个部署都针对独特的工作负载进行了优化。\n您计划部署三个应用程序。每个应用程序将通过 REST API 访问 AI1，并将使用针对该应用程序预期工作负载优化的部署。\n您需要为每个应用程序提供对 AI1 的访问权限和适当的部署。解决方案必须确保只有这些应用程序可以访问 AI1。\n您应该使用什么来提供对 AI1 的访问权限，每个应用程序应该使用什么来连接到其适当的部署？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry resource named AI1 that hosts three deployments of the GPT 3.5 model. Each deployment is optimized for a unique workload.\nYou plan to deploy three apps. Each app will access AI1 by using the REST API and will use the deployment that was optimized for the app’s intended workload.\nYou need to provide each app with access to AI1 and the appropriate deployment. The solution must ensure that only the apps can access AI1.\nWhat should you use to provide access to AI1, and what should each app use to connect to its appropriate deployment? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：一个持有者令牌\n通过以下方式提供对 AI1 的访问：\n获取一个持有者令牌以调用 OpenAI 资源。\n示例：\n1. 获取 Microsoft Entra 访问令牌。访问令牌在一小时内过期。您需要再获取一个。\nexport accessToken=$(az account get-access-token --resource https://cognitiveservices.azure.com --\n2. 进行 API 调用\n使用访问令牌通过设置 Authorization 头值来授权您的 API 调用。\n卷曲 ${endpoint%/}/openai/deployments/YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_NAME/completions?api-version=2023-05-\n15 \\\n-H“内容类型：application/json”\\\n-H \"授权: Bearer $accessToken\" \\\n-d '{ \"提示\": \"从前有一个\" }'\n框 2: 部署端点\n通过以下方式连接到部署:\n示例请求\n在此示例中，使用密码来验证服务主体。提供的令牌随后用于调用计算机视觉 API。\n1. 获取您的租户 ID:\n$context=获取-AzContext $context.Tenant.Id\n2. 获取令牌：\n$tenantId = $context.Tenant.Id\n$clientId = $app.ApplicationId\n$clientSecret =“<您的密码>”$resourceUrl\n=“https://cognitiveservices.azure.com/”$tokenEndpoi\nnt =“https://login.microsoftonline.com/$tenantId/oauth2/token”\n$body = @{\ngrant_type = \"client_credentials\"\nclient_id = $clientId\nclient_secret = $clientSecret\n资源 = $resourceUrl\n}\n$responseToken = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $tokenEndpoint -Method Post -Body $body\n$accessToken = $responseToken.access_token\n示例：\n3. 调用计算机视觉 API：\n$url = $account.Endpoint+\"vision/v1.0/models\"\n$result = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $url -Method Get -Headers @{\"Authorization\"=\"Bearer $accessToken\"}\n-Verbose\n$result | ConvertTo-Json",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: A bearer token\nProvide access to AI1 by using:\nObtain a bearer token to call the OpenAI resource.\nExample:\n1. Acquire a Microsoft Entra access token. Access tokens expire in one hour. you'll then need to acquire another one.\nexport accessToken=$(az account get-access-token --resource https://cognitiveservices.azure.com --\n2. Make an API call\nUse the access token to authorize your API call by setting the Authorization header value.\ncurl ${endpoint%/}/openai/deployments/YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_NAME/completions?api-version=2023-05-\n15 \\\n-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n-H \"Authorization: Bearer $accessToken\" \\\n-d '{ \"prompt\": \"Once upon a time\" }'\nBox 2: a deployment endpoint\nConnect to the deployment by using:\nSample request\nIn this sample, a password is used to authenticate the service principal. The token provided is then used to call the Computer Vision API.\n1. Get your TenantId:\n$context=Get-AzContext\n$context.Tenant.Id\n2. Get a token:\n$tenantId = $context.Tenant.Id\n$clientId = $app.ApplicationId\n$clientSecret = \"<YOUR_PASSWORD>\"\n$resourceUrl = \"https://cognitiveservices.azure.com/\"\n$tokenEndpoint = \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/$tenantId/oauth2/token\"\n$body = @{\n grant_type = \"client_credentials\"\n client_id = $clientId\n client_secret = $clientSecret\n resource = $resourceUrl\n}\n$responseToken = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $tokenEndpoint -Method Post -Body $body\n$accessToken = $responseToken.access_token\nExample:\n3. Call the Computer Vision API:\n$url = $account.Endpoint+\"vision/v1.0/models\"\n$result = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $url -Method Get -Headers @{\"Authorization\"=\"Bearer $accessToken\"}\n-Verbose\n$result | ConvertTo-Json",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution",
  "control": "select",
  "pdfRef": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案 · 问题集 2 · 问题 53",
  "pdfRefEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution · Question Set 2 · Question 53",
  "pdfPage": 57,
  "pdfSet": "问题集 2",
  "pdfSetEn": "Question Set 2",
  "pdfQNum": 53
