  "stemEn": "You have a Docker host named Host1 that contains a container base image.\nYou have an Azure subscription that contains a custom speech-to-text model named model1.\nYou need to run model1 on Host1.\nWhich three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "步骤 1：请求批准以运行容器\n前提条件\n在使用语音服务容器之前，您必须满足以下前提条件。如果您没有 Azure 订阅，请在开始之前创建一个免费帐户。您需要：\n* 您必须请求并获得使用语音容器的批准。\n* 等等。\n步骤 2：重新训练模型\n自定义模型必须使用语音工作室进行训练。\n步骤 3：运行容器。\n使用 docker run 运行容器\n使用 docker run 命令运行服务的容器。\n一旦运行，容器将继续运行，直到您停止容器。",
  "explanationEn": "Step 1: Request approval to run the container\nPrerequisites\nYou must meet the following prerequisites before you use Speech service containers. If you don't have an Azure subscription, create a free account before you begin. You need:\n* You must request and get approval to use a Speech container.\n* Etc.\nStep 2: Retrain the model\nThe custom model has to have been trained by using the Speech Studio.\nStep 3: Run the container.\nRun the container with docker run\nUse the docker run command to run the container for service.\nOnce running, the container continues to run until you stop the container.",
