  "stemZh": "您有 100,000 张图片。\n您需要构建一个应用程序，该应用程序将执行以下操作：\n● 识别图片中的交通标志并提取标志上的文本。\n● 分析文本以识别知名地点。\n解决方案必须最小化开发工作量。\n您应该为每个操作使用什么？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have 100,000 images.\nYou need to build an app that will perform the following actions:\n● Identify road signs in the images and extract the text on the signs.\n● Analyze the text to identify well-known locations.\nThe solution must minimize development effort.\nWhat should you use for each action? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1： Azure Vision 在 Foundry Tools\n提取文本：\n识别图片中的交通标志并提取标志上的文本。\n什么是 Azure AI Vision v4.0 Read OCR？\n新的 Azure AI Vision 图像分析 4.0 REST API 提供从图像中提取印刷或手写文本的能力，采用统一的性能增强同步 API，使您能够轻松获取所有图像洞察，包括在单个 API 操作中的 OCR 结果。Read OCR 引擎建立在多个深度学习模型之上，支持全球语言的通用脚本模型。\n框 2: Azure AI 搜索\n识别知名地点：\n分析文本以识别知名地点。\nAzure AI 搜索（以前称为“Azure 认知搜索”）是一个企业级的信息检索系统，用于处理您导入到搜索索引中的异构内容，并通过查询和应用程序向用户展示。它配备了一整套全面的高级搜索技术，旨在支持任何规模的高性能应用。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Azure Vision in Foundry Tools\nExtract the text:\nIdentify road signs in the images and extract the text on the signs.\nWhat is Azure AI Vision v4.0 Read OCR?\nThe new Azure AI Vision Image Analysis 4.0 REST API offers the ability to extract printed or handwritten text from images in a unified performance-enhanced synchronous API that makes it easy to get all image insights including OCR results in a single API operation. The Read OCR engine is built on top of multiple deep learning models supported by universal script-based models for global language support.\nBox 2: Azure AI Search\nIdentify well-known locations:\nAnalyze the text to identify well-known locations.\nAzure AI Search (formerly known as \"Azure Cognitive Search\") is an enterprise-ready information retrieval system for your heterogeneous content that you ingest into a search index, and surface to users through queries and apps. It comes with a comprehensive set of advanced search technologies, built for high-performance applications at any scale.",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution",
