  "stemZh": "您计划部署一个容器化版本的 Azure AI 语言服务，用于情感分析。\n您将 https://contoso.cognitiveservices.azure.com 配置为该服务的端点 URI。\n您需要通过 Docker 在 Azure 虚拟机上运行该容器。\n您应该如何完成该命令？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You plan to deploy a containerized version of an Azure AI Language service that will be used for sentiment analysis.\nYou configure https://contoso.cognitiveservices.azure.com as the endpoint URI for the service.\nYou need to run the container on an Azure virtual machine by using Docker.\nHow should you complete the command? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "解释：\n框 1: mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/sentiment\n安装并运行情感分析容器\n使用 docker run 运行容器\n一旦容器在主机计算机上，使用 docker run 命令来运行容器。该容器将继续运行，直到您停止它。\n重要\n以下部分中的 docker 命令使用反斜杠 \\ 作为行续字符。根据您的主机操作系统的要求替换或删除此内容。\n必须指定 Eula、Billing 和 ApiKey 选项才能运行容器；否则，容器将不会启动。\n示例：\ndocker run --rm -it -p 5000:5000 --memory 8g --cpus 1 \\\nmcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/sentiment:{IMAGE_TAG} \\\nEula=accept \\\n计费={ENDPOINT_URI}\nApiKey={API_KEY}\n此命令：\n从容器镜像运行情感分析容器分配一个 CPU 核心和 8 吉字节 ( GB) 的内存暴露 TCP 端口 5000 并为容器分配伪 TTY容器退出后自动删除。容器镜像仍然可在主机计算机上使用。\n框 2: https://contoso.cognitiveservices.azure.com\nENDPOINT_URI。\ncontainers",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/sentiment\nInstall and run Sentiment Analysis containers\nRun the container with docker run\nOnce the container is on the host computer, use the docker run command to run the containers. The container will continue to run until you stop it.\nImportant\nThe docker commands in the following sections use the back slash, \\, as a line continuation character. Replace or remove this based on your host operating system's requirements.\nThe Eula, Billing, and ApiKey options must be specified to run the container; otherwise, the container won't start.\nExample:\ndocker run --rm -it -p 5000:5000 --memory 8g --cpus 1 \\\nmcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/textanalytics/sentiment:{IMAGE_TAG} \\\nEula=accept \\\nBilling={ENDPOINT_URI} \\\nApiKey={API_KEY}\nThis command:\nRuns a Sentiment Analysis container from the container image\nAllocates one CPU core and 8 gigabytes (GB) of memory\nExposes TCP port 5000 and allocates a pseudo-TTY for the container\nAutomatically removes the container after it exits. The container image is still available on the host computer.\nBox 2: https://contoso.cognitiveservices.azure.com\nThe ENDPOINT_URI.\ncontainers",
  "domainLabelZh": "规划和管理 Azure AI 解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Plan and manage an Azure AI solution",
  "control": "select",
  "template": "docker run --rm -it -p 5000:5000 --memory 8g --cpus 1 \\\n  {{box1}} \\\n  Eula=accept \\\n  Billing={{box2}} \\\n  ApiKey=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "templateEn": "docker run --rm -it -p 5000:5000 --memory 8g --cpus 1 \\\n  {{box1}} \\\n  Eula=accept \\\n  Billing={{box2}} \\\n  ApiKey=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "templateZh": "docker run --rm -it -p 5000:5000 --memory 8g --cpus 1 \\\n  {{box1}} \\\n  Eula=accept \\\n  Billing={{box2}} \\\n  ApiKey=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
