  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您正在构建一个名为 App1 的 Web 应用，该应用通过使用部署到 Microsoft Foundry 项目 Project1 的模型生成响应。\nApp1 是多个客户端应用程序之一，这些应用程序将在向模型发送提示之前使用相同的 Azure AI Search 数据源配置。\n您需要整合 Project1 和 App1。解决方案必须满足以下要求：\n● 所有客户端应用程序必须使用相同的搜索配置。\n● 解决方案必须使用无密钥身份验证。\n● 必须最小化管理工作量。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You are building a web app named App1 that generates responses by using a model deployed to a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1.\nApp1 is one of several client applications that will use the same Azure AI Search data source configuration before sending prompts to the model.\nYou need to integrate Project1 and App1. The solution must meet the following requirements:\n● All client applications must use the same search configuration.\n● The solution must use keyless authentication.\n● Administrative effort must be minimized.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "在 Project1 中创建一个共享的 Azure AI Search 连接，配置为使用 Microsoft Entra ID身份验证，并具有适当的 Azure RBAC 权限。每个应用程序引用这个集中管理的连接，确保连接设置一致，并最小化管理工作量。\nMicrosoft Entra ID 提供无密钥身份验证，无需存储或轮换 API 密钥。",
  "explanationEn": "Create a shared Azure AI Search connection in Project1, configured to use Microsoft Entra ID\nauthentication with the appropriate Azure RBAC permissions. Each application references this centrally managed connection, ensuring consistent connection settings and minimizing administrative effort.\nMicrosoft Entra ID provides keyless authentication without storing or rotating API keys.",
