  "stemZh": "您需要确保 Agent1Dev 团队可以访问 Agent1。解决方案必须满足安全和合规要求。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You need to ensure that Agent1Dev Team can access Agent1. The solution must meet the security and compliance requirements.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "场景：\nContoso最近成立了一个新的AI工程团队，名为Agent1Dev Team，以优化和维护现有的AI解决方案。\nAgent1Dev 团队将使用 Project1 来优化和维护 Agent1。\n安全和合规要求：\nAPI 密钥必须 不 用于访问部署在 Foundry 的模型。\n访问 Azure 资源必须遵循最小权限原则。\nContoso 的开发人员必须通过 Microsoft Entra 认证来访问 Microsoft Foundry 资源。\n框 1：DefaultAzureCredential\n团队使用的正确凭证类型是 DefaultAzureCredential。\n强制无密钥访问：DefaultAzureCredential 通过使用基于令牌的身份验证满足第一个安全要求。这完全消除了对硬编码 API 密钥的需求。\n启用最小权限：它与 Microsoft Entra ID 基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）无缝集成。这允许管理员分配精确的细粒度角色（例如 Azure AI 开发者或 Foundry 用户角色）。\n原生 Entra 集成：它在运行时自动管理从 Microsoft Entra ID 获取令牌，满足原生 Microsoft Entra 身份验证的要求。\n框 2：get\nget 方法使用其唯一名称参数（agent_name）获取现有的面向消费者的代理定义。相比之下，create_version 将尝试构建一个全新的快照运行时配置，而 get_version 需要传递特定的版本标识符，而不是友好的代理名称。",
  "explanationEn": "Scenario:\nContoso recently formed a new AI engineering team named Agent1Dev Team to optimize and maintain existing AI solutions.\nAgent1Dev Team will use Project1 to optimize and maintain Agent1.\nSecurity and Compliance Requirements:\nAPI keys must NOT be used to access Foundry-deployed models.\nAccess to the Azure resources must follow the principle of least privilege.\nThe developers at Contoso must authenticate to Microsoft Foundry resources by using Microsoft Entra authentication.\nBox 1: DefaultAzureCredential\nThe correct credential type to use for the team is DefaultAzureCredential.\nEnforces Keyless Access: DefaultAzureCredential fulfills the first security requirement by using token-based authentication. This completely eliminates the need for hardcoded API keys.\nEnables Least Privilege: It integrates seamlessly with Microsoft Entra ID Role-Based Access Control (RBAC). This allows administrators to assign exact granular roles (such as the Azure AI Developer or Foundry User role).\nNative Entra Integration: It automatically manages token acquisition from Microsoft Entra ID during runtime, satisfying the requirement for native Microsoft Entra authentication.\nBox 2: get\nThe get method fetches the existing, consumer-facing definition of an agent using its unique name argument (agent_name). In contrast, create_version would attempt to build a brand new snapshotted runtime configuration, and get_version requires passing a specific version identifier rather than a friendly agent name",
  "domainLabelZh": "实现生成式 AI 与智能体解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Implement generative AI and agentic solutions",
  "control": "select",
  "template": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\nfrom azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\n\nmyEndpoint = \"https://contoso.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\"\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=myEndpoint,\n    credential={{1}},\n)\nmyAgent = \"Agent1\"\nagent = project_client.agents.{{2}}(agent_name=myAgent)\n\nprint(f\"Retrieved agent: {agent.name}\")",
  "templateEn": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\nfrom azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\n\nmyEndpoint = \"https://contoso.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\"\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=myEndpoint,\n    credential={{1}},\n)\nmyAgent = \"Agent1\"\nagent = project_client.agents.{{2}}(agent_name=myAgent)\n\nprint(f\"Retrieved agent: {agent.name}\")",
  "templateZh": "from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient\nfrom azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\n\nmyEndpoint = \"https://contoso.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project1\"\nproject_client = AIProjectClient(\n    endpoint=myEndpoint,\n    credential={{1}},\n)\nmyAgent = \"Agent1\"\nagent = project_client.agents.{{2}}(agent_name=myAgent)\n\nprint(f\"Retrieved agent: {agent.name}\")",
