  "stemZh": "您有一个包含已部署的票务分类代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您发现有时代理在没有调用任何工具的情况下响应，即使需要工具时也是如此。\n您需要确保代理在执行期间调用工具。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码？要回答，请将适当的值拖到正确的目标。每个值可以使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。您可能需要拖动窗格之间的分隔条或滚动以查看内容。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a deployed ticket-triage agent.\nYou discover that sometimes the agent responds without calling any tools, even when a tool is required.\nYou need to ensure that the agent calls a tool during execution.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "框 1: \"tool_choice\"\n要解决此问题并确保代理在执行期间始终调用工具，您需要在 run_payload 中配置 tool_choice 参数。\n框 2: \"必需\"\n在 Microsoft Foundry 的代理服务中（类似于底层的 Azure OpenAI / Assistants API 架构），设置 \"tool_choice\": \"必需\" 强制模型在返回响应之前选择并执行一个或多个工具。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: \"tool_choice\"\nTo fix this issue and ensure that the agent always calls a tool during execution, you need to configure the tool_choice parameter in the run_payload.\nBox 2: \"required\"\nIn Microsoft Foundry's Agent Service (similar to the underlying Azure OpenAI / Assistants API architecture), setting \"tool_choice\": \"required\" forces the model to select and execute one or more tools before returning its response.",
