  "stemZh": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目，其中包含一个由您公司的金融分析师使用的代理。\n您需要通过提供额外的数据访问和处理能力来优化代理工作流程。\n解决方案必须满足以下要求：\n确保代理在对话中能够进行计算。\n确保代理能够访问来自公共网站的最新信息。\n确保代理能够从直接上传到代理的文档中检索信息。\n您应该为每个要求使用什么？要回答，请将适当的工具拖到正确的要求上。每个工具可以使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。您可能需要拖动分隔条在窗格之间或滚动以查看内容。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent used by the financial analysts at your company.\nYou need to optimize the agent workflow by providing additional data access and processing capabilities. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nEnsure that the agent can perform calculations during conversations.\nEnsure that the agent can access up-to-date information from public websites.\nEnsure that the agent can retrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent. What should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate tools to the correct requirements. Each tool may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：与必应搜索的基础\n确保代理能够访问来自公共网站的最新信息。\n您应该使用与必应搜索的基础来优化您的 Microsoft Foundry 代理工作流程。\n大型语言模型（LLMs）受到固定知识截止日期的限制，无法本地访问实时信息。将与必应搜索的基础集成使您的代理能够自主获取最新的、公共网络数据，合成事实，并以准确的内联 URL 引用进行响应。\n框 2：代码解释器\n确保代理在对话中能够进行计算。\n要在 Microsoft Foundry 代理服务项目中满足此要求，您应该使用代理工具（特别是函数调用或代码解释器工具）。\n在 Microsoft 代理框架和 Foundry 代理服务中，工具是用于扩展代理推理能力的本地机制，超越文本生成，使其能够访问实时数据并在对话中执行精确的数学计算。\n框 3：文件搜索\n确保代理能够从直接上传到代理的文档中检索信息。\n为了使您的 Microsoft AI Foundry 代理能够直接引用和检索上传文档中的信息，您应该启用并配置文件搜索工具（通过 Foundry 代理服务）。该工具与代理的系统提示一起工作，直接在您的数据上执行检索增强生成（RAG）。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Grounding with Bing Search\nEnsure that the agent can access up-to-date information from public websites.\nYou should use Grounding with Bing Search to optimize your Microsoft Foundry agent workflow.\nLarge Language Models (LLMs) suffer from fixed knowledge cutoffs and cannot natively access real-time information. Integrating Grounding with Bing Search enables your agent to autonomously fetch up-to-date, public web data, synthesize facts, and respond with exact inline URL citations.\nBox 2: Code interpreter\nEnsure that the agent can perform calculations during conversations.\nTo fulfill this requirement in a Microsoft Foundry Agent Service project, you should use Agent Tools (specifically Function Calling or a Code Interpreter tool).\nIn the Microsoft Agent Framework and Foundry Agent Service, tools are the native mechanism used to extend an agent's reasoning capabilities beyond text generation, allowing them to access real-time data and perform exact mathematical computations during a conversation.\nBox 3: File Search\nEnsure that the agent can retrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent.\nTo give your Microsoft AI Foundry agent the capability to directly reference and retrieve information from uploaded documents, you should enable and configure the File Search tool (via the Foundry Agent Service). This tool functions alongside the agent's system prompts to perform Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) directly on your data.",
