  "type": "single",
  "stem": "您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文档中生成摘要。\n您需要提高响应的完整性。解决方案必须在响应返回之前在应用程序代码的逻辑中实现。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned",
    "textEn": "Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned.",
    "textZh": "在返回响应之前添加重试评估。"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "Decrease the value of the max_tokens parameter",
    "textEn": "Decrease the value of the max_tokens parameter.",
    "textZh": "减少 max_tokens 参数的值。"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "Switch to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)",
    "textEn": "Switch to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG).",
    "textZh": "切换到检索增强生成（RAG）。"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "Replace the model with a smaller deployment",
    "textEn": "Replace the model with a smaller deployment.",
    "textZh": "用更小的部署替换模型。"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "A"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "A"
  ],
  "explanation": "正确：\n* 在返回响应之前添加反思过程。\n反思过程作为您应用程序逻辑中的内部验证步骤。它指示代理evaluate其草拟响应与检索到的政策文件，以确保没有遗漏任何强制性监管条款。如果它检测到关键文本缺失，它会在发送给用户之前重新生成或修正答案。这直接满足了提高响应完整性的核心要求。\n* 在返回响应之前添加重试评估。\n您应该在应用程序代码中实现评估和重试循环。\n您必须将代理调用包装在一个条件代码循环中，该循环根据所需标准（例如监管条款的检查清单）评估输出，并在信息遗漏时程序性地强制重试。\n不正确：\n* 减少 max_tokens 参数的值。\n* 降低 temperature 参数的值。\n* 启用响应流。\n* 增加 presence_penalty 参数的值\n* 用更小的部署替换模型。\n* 切换到检索增强生成 (RAG)。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文档中生成摘要。\n您需要提高响应的完整性。解决方案必须在响应返回之前在应用程序代码的逻辑中实现。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nYou need to improve response completeness. The solution must be implemented in the logic of the application code before responses are returned.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "正确：\n* 在返回响应之前添加反思过程。\n反思过程作为您应用程序逻辑中的内部验证步骤。它指示代理evaluate其草拟响应与检索到的政策文件，以确保没有遗漏任何强制性监管条款。如果它检测到关键文本缺失，它会在发送给用户之前重新生成或修正答案。这直接满足了提高响应完整性的核心要求。\n* 在返回响应之前添加重试评估。\n您应该在应用程序代码中实现评估和重试循环。\n您必须将代理调用包装在一个条件代码循环中，该循环根据所需标准（例如监管条款的检查清单）评估输出，并在信息遗漏时程序性地强制重试。\n不正确：\n* 减少 max_tokens 参数的值。\n* 降低 temperature 参数的值。\n* 启用响应流。\n* 增加 presence_penalty 参数的值\n* 用更小的部署替换模型。\n* 切换到检索增强生成 (RAG)。",
  "explanationEn": "Correct:\n* Add a reflection pass before the responses are returned.\nA reflection pass acts as an internal verification step within your application's logic. It directs the agent to evaluate its own draft response against the retrieved policy documents to ensure no mandatory regulatory clauses were left out. If it detects that critical text is missing, it regenerates or amends the answer before sending it to the user. This directly fulfills the core requirement of improving response completeness.\n* Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned.\nYou should implement an evaluation and retry loop in your application code.\nYou must wrap the agent call inside a conditional code loop that evaluates the output against required criteria (such as a checklist of regulatory clauses), and programmatically forces a retry if information is omitted.\nIncorrect:\n* Decrease the value of the max_tokens parameter.\n* Decrease the value of the temperature paramerer.\n* Enable response streaming.\n* Increase the value of the presence_penalty parameter\n* Replace the model with a smaller deployment.\n* Switch to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG).",
  "boxes": [],
