  "type": "single",
  "stem": "您有一个使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 构建的客户支持代理。该代理调用一个 Azure OpenAI 模型部署。\n在负载测试期间，调用间歇性失败并返回 HTTP 429 超出速率限制错误。\n您需要处理限流以减少调用失败并提高负载下的可靠性。解决方案必须保持在服务和模型的限制内。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "Create a new thread and retry the calls immediately",
    "textEn": "Create a new thread and retry the calls immediately.",
    "textZh": "创建一个新线程并立即重试调用。"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "Reduce the number of registered tools",
    "textEn": "Reduce the number of registered tools.",
    "textZh": "减少注册的工具数量。"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "Implement a retry policy that uses exponential backoff and jitter",
    "textEn": "Implement a retry policy that uses exponential backoff and jitter.",
    "textZh": "实施使用指数退避和抖动的重试策略。"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "Split uploaded content into smaller files",
    "textEn": "Split uploaded content into smaller files.",
    "textZh": "将上传的内容拆分为较小的文件。"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "C"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "C"
  ],
  "explanation": "为了处理 HTTP 429 限流并提高 Microsoft Foundry AgentService 的负载测试可靠性，请在客户端实现带有抖动的指数退避，跨多个 Azure OpenAI 区域部署负载均衡网关，或将您的部署升级到预配吞吐量单位(PTU)。\n*-> 1. 实施客户端重试逻辑配置您的代理的 HTTP 客户端或 SDK，以优雅地处理 429 错误，而不是立即失败。\n指数退避：在后续重试尝试之间指数性地增加等待时间。\n抖动：在退避时间中添加少量随机延迟（抖动），以防止“雷鸣效应”即所有被限制的请求同时重试。\n头部检查：以编程方式从 HTTP 429 响应头中读取 Retry-After 或 x-ratelimit-reset 值，以暂停执行 Azure 请求的确切持续时间。\n2. 设置多区域负载均衡\n3. 切换到预配吞吐量 (PTU)\n4. 优化令牌消耗",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 构建的客户支持代理。该代理调用一个 Azure OpenAI 模型部署。\n在负载测试期间，调用间歇性失败并返回 HTTP 429 超出速率限制错误。\n您需要处理限流以减少调用失败并提高负载下的可靠性。解决方案必须保持在服务和模型的限制内。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You have a customer support agent built by using the Microsoft Foundry Agent Service. The agent calls an Azure OpenAI model deployment.\nDuring load testing, calls intermittently fail and return an HTTP 429 rate limit exceeded error.\nYou need to handle throttling to reduce call failures and improve reliability under load. The solution must remain within the service and model limits.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "为了处理 HTTP 429 限流并提高 Microsoft Foundry AgentService 的负载测试可靠性，请在客户端实现带有抖动的指数退避，跨多个 Azure OpenAI 区域部署负载均衡网关，或将您的部署升级到预配吞吐量单位(PTU)。\n*-> 1. 实施客户端重试逻辑配置您的代理的 HTTP 客户端或 SDK，以优雅地处理 429 错误，而不是立即失败。\n指数退避：在后续重试尝试之间指数性地增加等待时间。\n抖动：在退避时间中添加少量随机延迟（抖动），以防止“雷鸣效应”即所有被限制的请求同时重试。\n头部检查：以编程方式从 HTTP 429 响应头中读取 Retry-After 或 x-ratelimit-reset 值，以暂停执行 Azure 请求的确切持续时间。\n2. 设置多区域负载均衡\n3. 切换到预配吞吐量 (PTU)\n4. 优化令牌消耗",
  "explanationEn": "To handle HTTP 429 throttling and improve load testing reliability for your Microsoft Foundry Agent Service, implement exponential backoff with jitter on the client side, deploy a load-balancing gateway across multiple Azure OpenAI regions, or upgrade your deployment to Provisioned Throughput Units (PTU).\n*-> 1. Implement Client-Side Retry LogicConfigure your agent's HTTP client or SDK to handle 429 errors gracefully rather than failing immediately.\nExponential Backoff: Increase the wait time between subsequent retry attempts exponentially .\nJitter: Add a small amount of random delay (jitter) to the backoff time to prevent a \"thundering herd\" effect where all throttled requests retry simultaneously.\nHeader Inspection: Programmatically read the Retry-After or x-ratelimit-reset values from the HTTP 429 response headers to pause execution for the exact duration requested by Azure.\n2. Set Up Multi-Region Load Balancing\n3. Switch to Provisioned Throughput (PTU)\n4. Optimize Token Consumption",
  "boxes": [],
