  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您正在为一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目开发提示，该项目按类别对 incoming 支持票据进行分类。\n您需要通过向模型展示正确分类的样子来提高准确性，而不保留模型或永久存储知识。\n您应该使用哪种提示工程方法？",
  "stemEn": "You are developing prompts for a Microsoft Foundry project that classifies incoming support tickets by category.\nYou need to improve accuracy by showing the model how correct classifications look, without retaining the model or storing knowledge permanently.\nWhich prompt engineering approach should you use?",
  "explanationZh": "少样本提示是这个项目的最佳方法。这种技术通过在提示中直接包含几个高质量的示例来提高分类准确性，给模型提供一个清晰的模式，以便在不修改其权重或永久存储数据的情况下进行跟随。\n零重训练：在 API 调用期间完全通过上下文学习工作。\n无永久存储：知识在推理请求完成后立即消失。\n即时准确性提升：直接向模型展示格式、细微差别和边缘案例。",
  "explanationEn": "Few-shot prompting is the best approach for this project. This technique improves classification accuracy by including a few high-quality examples directly inside the prompt, giving the model a clear pattern to follow without modifying its weights or storing data permanently.\nZero retraining: Works entirely through in-context learning during the API call.\nNo permanent storage: The knowledge disappears as soon as the inference request is completed.\nImmediate accuracy boost: Demonstrates formatting, nuances, and edge cases directly to the model.",
