  "stemZh": "您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您需要启用长期记忆，以确保代理能够在不同对话中回忆用户偏好。存储的记忆必须针对每个经过身份验证的用户进行隔离，而不需要客户端应用程序手动生成用户 ID。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码？要回答，请将适当的值拖到正确的目标。每个值可以使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nYou need to enable long-term memory to ensure that the agent can recall user preferences across separate conversations. Stored memories must be isolated per authenticated user without the client application manually generating user IDs.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more than once, or not at all.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "框 1: \"{{$userId}}\"\n用户隔离（范围）\n设置范围=\"{{$userId}}\" 指示 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 自动映射和划分内存给使用其 Microsoft Entra 用户身份模板的登录个体。该平台动态处理请求头，从而消除手动客户端用户 ID 管理的需要。\n框 2: [memory_tool]\n工具列表: 工具配置参数期望一个包含实例化工具对象的可迭代对象。将 memory_tool 包裹在 Python 列表中 ([memory_tool]) 使该能力暴露给代理定义。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: \"{{$userId}}\"\nUser Isolation (Scope)\nSetting scope=\"{{$userId}}\" instructs the Microsoft Foundry Agent Service to automatically map and partition memory to the logged-in individual using their Microsoft Entra user identity template. The platform handles this dynamically from request headers, removing the need for manual client-side user ID management\nBox 2: [memory_tool]\nTool List: The tools configuration parameter expects an iterable containing instantiated tool objects. Wrapping memory_tool inside a Python list ([memory_tool]) exposes the capability to the agent definition.",
  "domainLabelZh": "实现生成式 AI 与智能体解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Implement generative AI and agentic solutions",
  "control": "select",
  "pdfRef": "实现生成式 AI 与智能体解决方案 · 问题集 2 · 问题 24",
