  "explanation": "要配置对请求工作流每个步骤的端到端可见性，您应该在项目中启用应用程序跟踪。\n项目级可观察性：启用应用程序跟踪允许 Microsoft Foundry 原生跟踪、追踪，并监控工作流的每个组件——包括对 Azure OpenAI 响应 API 的调用和相关工具如 Azure AI 内容安全——在同一请求中，无需复杂的、单独的 SDK 配置。\n集中跟踪：跟踪捕获项目端点之间的确切执行路径，使您能够顺序查看模型调用和内容安全检查的指标、延迟和输入/输出。",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个名为 App1 的 Web 应用程序，通过与名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目集成来处理用户提示。App1 执行以下操作：\n通过使用 Azure OpenAI Responses API 直接将提示发送到模型\n通过在同一请求中使用 Foundry 连接调用 Azure AI 内容安全工具\n您需要配置对请求工作流每个步骤的端到端可见性。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You have a web app named App1 that processes user prompts by integrating with a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1. App1 performs the following actions:\nSends prompts directly to a model by using the Azure OpenAI Responses API\nInvokes the Azure AI Content Safety tool by using a Foundry connection within the same request\nYou need to configure end-to-end visibility into each step of the request workflow.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "要配置对请求工作流每个步骤的端到端可见性，您应该在项目中启用应用程序跟踪。\n项目级可观察性：启用应用程序跟踪允许 Microsoft Foundry 原生跟踪、追踪，并监控工作流的每个组件——包括对 Azure OpenAI 响应 API 的调用和相关工具如 Azure AI 内容安全——在同一请求中，无需复杂的、单独的 SDK 配置。\n集中跟踪：跟踪捕获项目端点之间的确切执行路径，使您能够顺序查看模型调用和内容安全检查的指标、延迟和输入/输出。",
  "explanationEn": "To configure end-to-end visibility into each step of the request workflow, you should Enable application tracing in the project.\nProject-Level Observability: Enabling application tracing allows Microsoft Foundry to natively track, trace, and monitor every component of the workflow—including calls to the Azure OpenAI Responses API and associated tools like Azure AI Content Safety—within the same request without requiring complex, separate SDK configurations.\nCentralized Tracking: Tracing captures the exact execution path across the project endpoints, allowing you to see metrics, latency, and inputs/outputs sequentially for both the model invocation and the content safety check.",
