  "stemZh": "注意：此问题是一个系列问题的一部分，这些问题呈现相同的场景。系列中的每个问题包含一个独特的解决方案，可能满足所述目标。一些问题集可能有多个正确解决方案，而其他问题集可能没有正确解决方案。\n在您回答本节中的问题后，您将无法返回到该问题。因此，这些问题将不会出现在复习屏幕中。\n您拥有一个包含名为 AI1 的 Microsoft Foundry 资源和一个名为 CS1 的内容安全控制平面资源的 Azure 订阅。\n您构建了一个代理，使用 AI1 为特定问题提供生成性答案，并使用 CS1 检查输入和输出是否包含不当内容。\n您需要通过对样本问题进行测试来优化内容过滤器配置。\n解决方案：在内容安全工作室中，您使用监控在线活动功能来运行测试。\n这符合要求吗？",
  "stemEn": "Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution. After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.\nYou have an Azure subscription that contains a Microsoft Foundry resource named AI1 and a Content Safety in Foundry Control Plane resource named CS1.\nYou build an agent that uses AI1 to provide generative answers to specific questions and CS1 to check input and output for objectionable content.\nYou need to optimize the content filter configurations by running tests on sample questions.\nSolution: From Content Safety Studio, you use the Monitor online activity feature to run the tests.\nDoes this meet the requirement?",
  "explanationZh": "正确：\n* 在内容安全工作室中，您使用“适度文本内容”功能来运行测试。\n您应该使用内容安全工作室中的适度文本来运行测试并优化内容过滤器配置。\n检测有害内容：适度文本功能专门识别输入和输出中的有害、冒犯或令人反感的文本。\n测试配置：它允许您通过过滤器设置运行样本提示和文本，以验证阈值和阻止列表。\n不正确：\n* 在内容安全工作室中，您使用“监控在线活动”功能来运行测试。\n* 在内容安全工作室中，您使用“受保护材料检测”功能来运行测试。\n* 在内容安全工作室中，您使用“安全元提示”功能来运行测试。",
  "explanationEn": "Correct:\n* From Content Safety Studio, you use the Moderate text content feature to run the tests.\nYou should use Moderate text from the Content Safety Studio to run the tests and optimize the content filter configurations.\nDetects Harmful Content: The Moderate text feature specifically identifies harmful, offensive, or objectionable text in inputs and outputs.\nTests Configurations: It allows you to run sample prompts and text through filter setups to verify thresholds and block lists.\nIncorrect:\n* From Content Safety Studio, you use the Monitor online activity feature to run the tests.\n* From Content Safety Studio, you use the Protected material detection feature to run the tests.\n* From Content Safety Studio, you use the Safety metaprompt feature to run the tests.",
