  "stemZh": "您有一个生产食品产品纸板包装的工厂。该工厂的互联网连接不稳定。\n包装要求包含每种产品的四个样本。\n您需要构建一个 Azure 自定义视觉模型，以识别包装中的缺陷并提供缺陷的位置通知给操作员。模型必须确保每个包裹包含四个产品。\n您应该使用哪种项目类型和领域？要回答这个问题，请将适当的选项移动到正确的目标。您可以每个选项使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。您可能需要移动窗格之间的分隔条或滚动以查看内容。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You have a factory that produces cardboard packaging for food products. The factory has intermittent internet connectivity.\nThe packages are required to include four samples of each product.\nYou need to build an Azure Custom Vision model that will identify defects in packaging and provide the location of the defects to an operator. The model must ensure that each package contains the four products.\nWhich project type and domain should you use? To answer, move the appropriate options to the correct targets. You may use each option once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to move the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：目标检测\n此场景的最佳项目类型是使用通用（紧凑型）领域的目标检测。\n项目类型：目标检测是必需的，因为您必须识别缺陷在包装上的存在和具体位置（坐标），并且还要计算单个物品以验证每个包装中是否包含所需数量的产品。\n定位缺陷：与图像分类（仅将整个图像标记为好或坏）不同，目标检测在单个缺陷和物品周围绘制边界框。\n计数物品：边界坐标允许系统验证包装边界内是否存在所有所需的产品样本。\n处理边缘约束：导出紧凑型模型允许在现场执行，而无需依赖持续的云连接。\n框 2：通用（紧凑型）\n通用（紧凑型）是必不可少的，因为工厂的互联网连接不稳定。紧凑型领域可以导出并在边缘设备上本地运行，以进行离线实时推理。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Object Detection\nThe best project type for this scenario is Object Detection using the General (compact) domain.\nProject Type: Object Detection is required because you must identify both the presence and the specific location (coordinates) of the defects on the packaging, as well as count the individual items to verify that each package contains the required number of products.\nLocates Defects: Unlike image classification (which only tags an entire image as good or bad), object detection draws bounding boxes around individual defects and items.\nCounts Items: Bounding coordinates allow the system to verify if all required product samples are present inside the package bounds.\nHandles Edge Constraints: Exporting the compact model allows on-site execution without relying on a continuous cloud connection.\nBox 2: General (compact)\nGeneral (compact) is essential because the factory has intermittent internet connectivity. Compact domains can be exported and run locally on edge devices for offline, real-time inference.",
  "domainLabelZh": "实现生成式 AI 与智能体解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Implement generative AI and agentic solutions",
