  "stem": "您有一个名为 App1 的应用程序，它使用 Microsoft Foundry 多模态模型部署。\nApp1 对上传的图像进行光学字符识别 (OCR)，并将 OCR 输出附加到提示中作为额外的上下文。\n一些上传的图像包含嵌入的文本。\n您需要防止潜在的恶意指令被模型处理。\n你应该使用什么？",
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "image moderation",
    "textEn": "image moderation",
    "textZh": "图像审核"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "prompt shields for documents",
    "textEn": "prompt shields for documents",
    "textZh": "文档的提示保护"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "protected material text",
    "textEn": "protected material text",
    "textZh": "受保护材料文本"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "prompt shields for user prompts",
    "textEn": "prompt shields for user prompts",
    "textZh": "用户提示的提示保护"
   }
  ],
  "answer": [
   "B"
  ],
  "pdfAnswer": [
   "B"
  ],
  "explanation": "为了防止潜在的恶意指令嵌入在不受信任的外部来源中（例如通过 OCR 从上传的图像提取的文本）被模型处理，您应该使用文档的提示保护（专门设计用于间接提示攻击或跨域提示注入）。\n实施的关键特性\n文档的提示保护：Azure AI 内容安全 / 提示保护的这个特定组件分析附加到提示的外部数据——如从文件、电子邮件或 OCR 输出中提取的文本。它识别并中和试图欺骗模型以覆盖其系统协议的隐藏对抗性指令。\n聚焦：Microsoft Foundry 的提示保护中的一种原生能力，聚焦使用先进的文本格式化技术将有效的用户命令与不受信任的文档文本分开。这防止模型将嵌入在 OCR 输出中的恶意指令误认为是开发者或最终用户的指令。\nga/4236033",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个名为 App1 的应用程序，它使用 Microsoft Foundry 多模态模型部署。\nApp1 对上传的图像进行光学字符识别 (OCR)，并将 OCR 输出附加到提示中作为额外的上下文。\n一些上传的图像包含嵌入的文本。\n您需要防止潜在的恶意指令被模型处理。\n你应该使用什么？",
  "stemEn": "You have an app named App1 that uses a Microsoft Foundry multimodal model deployment.\nApp1 runs optical character recognition (OCR) on uploaded images and appends the OCR output to the prompt as additional context.\nSome uploaded images contain embedded text.\nYou need to prevent potentially malicious instructions from being processed by the model.\nWhat should you use?",
  "explanationZh": "为了防止潜在的恶意指令嵌入在不受信任的外部来源中（例如通过 OCR 从上传的图像提取的文本）被模型处理，您应该使用文档的提示保护（专门设计用于间接提示攻击或跨域提示注入）。\n实施的关键特性\n文档的提示保护：Azure AI 内容安全 / 提示保护的这个特定组件分析附加到提示的外部数据——如从文件、电子邮件或 OCR 输出中提取的文本。它识别并中和试图欺骗模型以覆盖其系统协议的隐藏对抗性指令。\n聚焦：Microsoft Foundry 的提示保护中的一种原生能力，聚焦使用先进的文本格式化技术将有效的用户命令与不受信任的文档文本分开。这防止模型将嵌入在 OCR 输出中的恶意指令误认为是开发者或最终用户的指令。\nga/4236033",
  "explanationEn": "To prevent potentially malicious instructions embedded within untrusted external sources (such as text extracted from uploaded images via OCR) from being processed by the model, you should use Prompt Shields for Documents (specifically designed for Indirect Prompt Attacks or Cross-Domain Prompt Injections).\nKey Features to Implement\nPrompt Shields for Documents: This specific component of Azure AI Content Safety / Prompt Shields analyzes external data—like text pulled from files, emails, or OCR outputs—appended to the prompt. It identifies and neutralizes hidden adversarial instructions trying to trick the model into overriding its system protocols.\nSpotlighting: A native capability within Microsoft Foundry's Prompt Shields, Spotlighting uses advanced text-formatting techniques to separate valid user commands from the untrusted document text. This prevents the model from mistaking malicious instructions embedded inside the OCR output for instructions from the developer or end-user.\nga/4236033",
  "boxes": [],
