  "stemZh": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目，使用 Azure 内容理解在 Foundry 工具中分析营销视频。\n视频分割已启用。\n您需要配置一个分析器，以输出描述每个视频片段颜色方案的生成 JSON 字段。\n您应该如何配置分析器？要回答，请将适当的值拖到正确的目标。每个值可以使用一次、使用多次或根本不使用。您可能需要拖动窗格之间的分隔条或滚动以查看内容。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。\n选择和放置：",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that uses Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools to analyze marketing videos.\nVideo segmentation is enabled.\nYou need to configure an analyzer to output a generated JSON field that describes the color scheme of each video segment.\nHow should you configure the analyzer? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.\nSelect and Place:",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：字符串\n类型（字符串）：虽然您希望输出模式包含颜色调色板或样式的描述，Azure 内容理解模式使用基本类型（如字符串、数字或数组）映射底层数据类型。该字段将在 JSON 响应中以类似 \"valueString\" 的键输出最终结果。框 2：生成方法（生成）：提取方法仅用于精确提取内容中出现的文字（例如语音转文本的转录或 OCR）。因为分析视觉美学和合成关于“颜色方案”的描述性文本需要多模态 AI 推理，您必须使用生成方法。这指示底层模型分析该片段并合成全新的描述性见解。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: string\nThe Type (string): While you want the output schema to contain a description of the color palette or style, Azure Content Understanding schemas map the underlying data types using fundamental types like string, number, or array. The field will output the final result in the JSON response under a key like \"valueString\"\nBox 2: generate\nThe Method (generate): The extract method is only used for pulling literal text exactly as it appears in content (such as speech-to-text transcripts or OCR). Because analyzing visual aesthetics and synthesizing descriptive text about a \"color scheme\" requires multimodal AI reasoning, you must use the generate method. This instructs the underlying model to analyze the segment and synthesize a completely new descriptive insight.",
