  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "medium",
  "answerFixed": false,
  "stemZh": "您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目，用于生成短促销产品视频。\n在几个剪辑获得批准后，审阅者注意到某些视频的右上角有一个小水印。\n您需要在不重新生成视频的情况下去除水印。\n您应该怎么做？",
  "stemEn": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that generates short promotional product videos.\nAfter several clips are approved, reviewers notice a small watermark in the top-right corner of some videos.\nYou need to remove the watermark without regenerating the videos.\nWhat should you do?",
  "explanationZh": "正确的操作是对视频受影响部分应用基于掩码的修复编辑。\n这是唯一一个直接修改现有已批准视频文件的选项。修复允许您使用掩码隔离特定的右上角，并与周围像素无缝融合，以 erase 水印，而不改变或重新生成其余视频画面。",
  "explanationEn": "The correct action to take is to apply a mask-based inpainting edit to the affected part of the video.\nThis is the only option that directly modifies the existing, approved video files. Inpainting allows you to isolate the specific top-right corner using a mask and seamlessly blend it with the surrounding pixels to erase the watermark without altering or regenerating the rest of the video footage.",
