  "stemZh": "您正在构建一个自定义视觉模型，该模型将作为 iOS 应用的一部分进行部署。\n您有猫和狗的图像。每张图像包含一只猫或一只狗。\n您需要使用 Azure 自定义视觉服务来检测图像是猫还是狗。\n您应该如何在 Azure 自定义视觉门户中配置项目？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意: 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You are building a custom vision model that will be deployed as part of an iOS app.\nYou have images of cats and dogs. Each image contains either a cat or a dog.\nYou need to use the Azure Custom Vision service to detect whether the image is of a cat or a dog.\nHow should you configure the project in the Azure Custom Vision portal? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：分类\n您应该使用分类项目类型，而不是对象检测。\n项目要求：您的目标是识别图像的整体内容是否属于特定类别（猫或狗）。分类目的：Azure AI 自定义视觉图像分类器根据图像的整体视觉特征为整个图像应用内容标签。\n框 2：多类（每张图像一个标签）\n图像约束：由于每张图像仅包含一种独特的动物，您将其配置为多类（每张图像一个标签）分类类型。\n框 3：一般（紧凑）\n域：选择一个通用（紧凑型）域。紧凑型域生成专门为边缘设备和移动性能优化的轻量级模型。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Classification\nYou should use the Classification project type rather than Object detection.\nProject Requirement: Your goal is to identify whether the overall content of the image belongs to a specific category (a cat or a dog).Classification Purpose: An Azure AI Custom Vision image classifier applies content labels to an entire image based on its overall visual characteristics.\nBox 2: Multiclass (Single tag per image)\nImage Constraints: Because each image contains only one distinct animal, you will configure this as a Multiclass (Single tag per image) classification type.\nBox 3: General (compact)\nDomain: Select a General (compact) domain. Compact domains generate lightweight models specifically optimized for edge devices and mobile performance.",
