  "explanationEn": "To extract text from one million of scanned magazine articles with minimal development effort, you should include the Read API in Azure Computer Vision (Azure Vision in Foundry Tools).\nOptimized for Text-Heavy Images: The Read OCR model is specifically engineered to extract printed and handwritten text from document-style images, making it perfect for scanned magazine layouts.\nAsynchronous Processing: It utilizes an asynchronous API designed to handle large-scale, high-volume workloads seamlessly.\nMinimal Development Effort: It operates as a pre-built, fully managed AI service. You do not need to train, label, or build custom layout models—simply send the image and receive structured text layout output.",
