    "textEn": "Replace ContactInfo by using Phone, Email, and SocialMedia entities. Relabel every matching span.",
    "textZh": "使用 Phone、Email 和 SocialMedia 实体替换 ContactInfo。重新标记每个匹配的跨度。"
