  "explanationZh": "两个地方伦敦和白金汉宫将被识别。\n注意：命名实体识别（NER）是Azure AI语言提供的功能之一，这是一个集合用于开发涉及书面语言的智能应用程序的云中的机器学习和AI算法。NER功能可以识别和分类非结构化文本中的实体。例如：人、地点 written、组织和数量。预构建的NER功能具有预设的已识别实体列表。\n自定义NER功能允许您训练模型以识别特定于您的用例的专业实体。\nour use",
  "explanationEn": "The two places London and Buckingham Palace will be recognized.\nNote: Named Entity Recognition (NER) is one of the features offered by Azure AI Language, a collection of machine learning and AI algorithms in the cloud for developing intelligent applications that involve language. The NER feature can identify and categorize entities in unstructured text. For example: people, places, organizations, and quantities. The prebuilt NER feature has a pre-set list of recognized entities.\ncase.\nThe custom NER feature allows you to train the model to recognize specialized entities specific to y",
