  "stemZh": "您正在构建一个学生将用来查找论文参考资料的解决方案。\n您使用以下代码开始构建解决方案。\n```\nfrom azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\nfrom azure.ai.textanalytics import TextAnalyticsClient\n\nendpoint = os.environ[\"AZURE_TEXT_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT\"]\nkey = os.environ[\"AZURE_TEXT_ANALYTICS_KEY\"]\n\ntext_analytics_client = TextAnalyticsClient(endpoint=endpoint, credential=AzureKeyCredential(key))\ndocuments = [\n    \"\"\"\n    Our tour guide took us up the Space Needle during our trip to Seattle last week.\n    \"\"\"\n]\n\nresult = text_analytics_client.recognize_linked_entities(documents)\n```\n对于以下每个陈述，如果该陈述为真，请选择“是”。否则，请选择“否”。\n注意: 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You are building a solution that students will use to find references for essays.\nYou use the following code to start building the solution.\n```\nfrom azure.core.credentials import AzureKeyCredential\nfrom azure.ai.textanalytics import TextAnalyticsClient\n\nendpoint = os.environ[\"AZURE_TEXT_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT\"]\nkey = os.environ[\"AZURE_TEXT_ANALYTICS_KEY\"]\n\ntext_analytics_client = TextAnalyticsClient(endpoint=endpoint, credential=AzureKeyCredential(key))\ndocuments = [\n    \"\"\"\n    Our tour guide took us up the Space Needle during our trip to Seattle last week.\n    \"\"\"\n]\n\nresult = text_analytics_client.recognize_linked_entities(documents)\n```\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes is the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1: 否\nTextAnalyticsClient.RecognizeLinkedEntities 方法运行一个预测模型，以识别传入文档中发现的一组实体，并包含将这些实体与著名知识库中相应条目链接的信息。\n此方法有一个语言参数作为输入：language (String)文档所写的语言。如果未指定，则该值将设置为发送到服务的请求中的默认语言 DefaultLanguage。如果设置为空字符串，则服务将应用一个模型，其中语言明确设置为“None”。\n框 2: 是\n该方法返回\n响应<LinkedEntityCollection>\n一个结果，包含在文档中识别出的链接实体集合，以及指示实体正确匹配识别子字符串的置信度分数。\nLinkedEntityCollection 类是文档中 LinkedEntity 对象的集合，以及在处理文档时遇到的警告。\nLinkedEntity 具有一个属性 Url，该属性获取标识链接实体在数据源中条目的 URL。\nBingEntitySearchApiId 属性是识别实体的 Bing 实体搜索 API 唯一标识符。与 Bing 实体搜索 API 一起使用，以获取额外的相关信息。\n框 3：是\nMatches 属性/属性是一个集合，标识文档中与此链接实体对应的子字符串。\nLinkedEntityMatch 结构具有以下属性：\n置信度\n获取一个介于 0 和 1 之间的分数，表示该子字符串与对应链接实体匹配的信心。\n长度\n获取句子中匹配文本的长度。\n抵消\n获取文档中匹配文本的起始位置。\n文本\n获取实体文本在文档中的显示形式。\nazure.ai.textanalytics.textanalyticsclient.recognizelinkedentities",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: No\nThe TextAnalyticsClient.RecognizeLinkedEntities method runs a predictive model to identify a collection of entities found in the passed-in document, and include information linking the entities to their corresponding entries in a well-known knowledge base.\nThis method has a language parameter as input: language (String)\nThe language that the document is written in. If unspecified, this value will be set to the default language in DefaultLanguage in the request sent to the service. If set to an empty string, the service will apply a model where the language is explicitly set to \"None\".\nBox 2: Yes\nThe method returns\nResponse<LinkedEntityCollection>\nA result containing the collection of linked entities identified in the document, as well as scores indicating the confidence that the entity correctly matches the identified substring.\nThe LinkedEntityCollection Class is a collection of LinkedEntity objects in a document, and warnings encountered while processing the document.\nThe LinkedEntity has a property Url which gets the URL that identifies the linked entity's entry in the data source.\nThe BingEntitySearchApiId property is a Bing Entity Search API unique identifier of the recognized entity. Use in conjunction with the Bing Entity Search API to fetch additional relevant information.\nBox 3: Yes\nThe Matches attribute/property is a collection identifying the substrings of the document that correspond to this linked entity.\nThe LinkedEntityMatch struct has the properties:\nConfidenceScore\nGets a score between 0 and 1, indicating the confidence that this substring matches the corresponding linked entity.\nLength\nGets the length of the matching text in the sentence.\nOffset\nGets the starting position for the matching text in the document.\nText\nGets the entity text as it appears in the document.\nazure.ai.textanalytics.textanalyticsclient.recognizelinkedentities",
  "domainLabelZh": "实现文本分析解决方案",
  "domainLabelEn": "Implement text analysis solutions",
  "control": "yn",
