  "stemZh": "您在 Microsoft Foundry 项目中有一个可配置的护栏。\n您有一个 Python 应用程序。一个名为 ConfidentialTerms 的文本黑名单已经包含了必须在用户消息中检测的术语。该应用程序将每条传入的用户消息存储在一个名为 input_text 的变量中。\n您计划在将 input_text 发送到语言模型之前进行审核。\n您需要使用现有的黑名单分析 input_text。\n您应该如何完成代码？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a configurable guardrail in a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou have a Python application. A text blocklist named ConfidentialTerms already contains terms that must be detected in user messages. The application stores each incoming user message in a variable named input_text.\nYou plan to moderate input_text before the text is sent to a language model.\nYou need to analyze input_text by using the existing blocklist.\nHow should you complete the code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：AnalyzeTextOptions\n这是用于封装文本分析请求参数的模型类。它包含要评估的文本、要过滤的黑名单名称集合，以及像 halt_on_blocklist_hit 这样的配置标志。\n框 2：client.analyze_text\n这是 ContentSafetyClient 暴露的执行方法。它将请求对象中配置的有效负载传输到云端终端，并返回一个对象，详细说明哪些（如果有的话）黑名单元素或安全类别被触发。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: AnalyzeTextOptions\nThis is the model class used to encapsulate parameters for text analysis requests. It holds the text to evaluate, the collection of blocklist_names to filter against, and configuration flags like halt_on_blocklist_hit.\nBox 2: client.analyze_text\nThis is the executive method exposed by the ContentSafetyClient. It transmits the payload configured in the request object to the cloud endpoint and returns an object detailing which, if any, blocklist elements or safety categories were triggered.",
