  "explanationEn": "Azure Language in Foundry Tools provides sentiment analysis to identify positive, neutral, and negative sentiment in social media text, helping measure public perception of your brand. Its opinion mining feature associates opinions with specific product or service attributes for more detailed insights.\nsentiment-analysis",
