  "stemZh": "您有一个 Python 应用程序，通过使用 REST API 将客户支持记录发送到 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Language。这些记录是英文的，可能包含客户姓名、电子邮件地址和电话号码。\n您需要存储每次对话的已编辑记录。支持工作流程必须仅编辑客户姓名，而保持其他实体类型不变。\n您应该如何完成 analyze-text 请求体？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a Python application that sends customer support transcripts to Azure Language in Foundry Tools by using the REST API. The transcripts are in English and can contain customer names, email addresses, and phone numbers.\nYou need to store a redacted transcript of each conversation. The support workflow must redact only customer names and leave other entity types unchanged.\nHow should you complete the analyze-text request body? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
