  "explanationEn": "PiiEntityRecognition detects sensitive entities and returns a redactedText field. Restricting piiCategories to Person redacts detected person names while leaving email addresses and phone numbers unchanged. Store the returned redactedText as the redacted transcript.\nhow-to/redact-text-pii?trk=public_post_comment-text",
