  "stemZh": "您正在创建一个将使用 Azure AI 搜索的增强管道。知识库包含非结构化的 JSON 数据和扫描的 PDF 文档中的文本。\n对于每种数据类型，您应该使用哪种投影类型？要回答，请在答案区域选择适当的选项。\n注意： 每个正确的选择值为一分。",
  "stemEn": "You are creating an enrichment pipeline that will use Azure AI Search. The knowledge store contains unstructured JSON data and the text from scanned PDF documents.\nWhich projection type should you use for each data type? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanationZh": "框 1：对象投影\n对于非结构化的 JSON 数据，您必须使用对象投影，对于从扫描的 PDF 文档中提取的文本数据，您必须使用文件投影。\n对象投影：将您的数据投影为完整的 JSON 表示。它非常适合在 Azure Blob Storage 中保持原始结构以及任何应用的 AI 增强功能，所有这些都在单个 JSON 文档中。\n框 2：文件投影\n文件投影：捕获在光学字符识别（OCR）处理过程中所需的二进制或图像提取层。它将原始文本和图形细节直接从非结构化的物理二进制文件中隔离并输出到指定的容器中。",
  "explanationEn": "Box 1: Object projection\nFor the unstructured JSON data, you must use object projection, and for the extracted text data from the scanned PDF documents, you must use file projection.\nObject Projection: Projects your data as a full JSON representation. It is ideal for maintaining the original structure alongside any applied AI enrichments within a single JSON document inside Azure Blob Storage.\nBox 2: File projection\nFile Projection: Captures the binary or image extraction layer required during Optical Character Recognition (OCR) processing. It isolates and outputs raw text and graphic details directly from unstructured physical binary files into a designated container",
