  "explanationEn": "Advanced data parsing extracts content from scanned PDFs while preserving headings and table structure. It can merge tables spanning multiple pages and create structure-aware chunks containing page-number and section metadata. Reingesting the documents rebuilds the knowledge source with this information, supporting accurate retrieval of specific table rows and their source pages.",
